  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "b3_u07_l2_g1",
      "pattern": "반말 1: A/V-아/어, N(이)야, -았/었어",
      "meaning_uz": "Oddiy (\"sen\") uslub: hozirgi va o'tgan",
      "meaning_en": "Casual speech: present and past",
      "explanation_md": "**반말** — yaqin do'stlar, tengdoshlar va kichiklar bilan ishlatiladigan **oddiy (\"sen\") uslub**. Uni yasash juda oson: muloyim shakldan **-요 ni olib tashlaysiz**.\n\n**우리 동갑이야!** — *Biz tengdoshmiz!*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n| Muloyim | 반말 |\n|---|---|\n| 먹어요 | **먹어** |\n| 가요 | **가** |\n| 했어요 | **했어** |\n| 좋아요 | **좋아** |\n| 학생이에요 | **학생이야** |\n| 친구예요 | **친구야** |\n\n- Ot → **N이야** (받침 bilan) / **N야** (받침siz)\n- Ha / yo'q → **응 / 아니**\n- \"Men\" → **나**, \"mening\" → **내**, \"sen\" → **너**\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- Faqat **ruxsat** bo'lsa: **우리 말 놓을까요?** — *\"Sen\"lashaylikmi?* deb so'rab, keyin o'tiladi.\n- Kattalarga (선배, o'qituvchi, notanish) — doim **존댓말**.",
      "explanation_md_en": "**반말** is **casual speech**, used with close friends, people your age and younger people. It's easy to form: just **drop the -요** from the polite form.\n\n**우리 동갑이야!** — *We're the same age!*\n\n### How to form it\n\n| Polite | Casual |\n|---|---|\n| 먹어요 | **먹어** |\n| 가요 | **가** |\n| 했어요 | **했어** |\n| 좋아요 | **좋아** |\n| 학생이에요 | **학생이야** |\n| 친구예요 | **친구야** |\n\n- Noun → **N이야** (with 받침) / **N야** (no 받침)\n- Yes / no → **응 / 아니**\n- \"I\" → **나**, \"my\" → **내**, \"you\" → **너**\n\n### Remember\n\n- Only with **permission**: ask **우리 말 놓을까요?** (\"shall we speak casually?\"), then switch.\n- With seniors, teachers and strangers, always use **존댓말**.",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "Fe'l/sifat",
          "condition_en": "Verb/adjective",
          "rule": "-아요/어요 → -아/어",
          "example": "먹어요 → 먹어, 좋아요 → 좋아"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "O'tgan",
          "condition_en": "Past",
          "rule": "-았/었어요 → -았/었어",
          "example": "했어요 → 했어"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Ot",
          "condition_en": "Noun",
          "rule": "N이야 / N야",
          "example": "학생이야, 친구야"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
